{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVupvbvvAgmuFoWacepA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I approved the report and wrote `verdict.json` in the work folder.\n\nI re-ran the regression and tried three variants. The remote-work coefficient stays small and not statistically significant in all of them.\n\n- **Without the baseline:** the analyst's setup (size and age controls, no 2020 patent baseline) gives about -0.2 patents per 100 engineers (p = 0.40 in my version without the 1% trim; the report's trimmed run gave p = 0.33).\n- **With the 2020 patent baseline:** the estimate is about -0.28 (p = 0.24).\n- **With all pre-period covariates, region, listed status and segment:** the estimate is about -0.28 (p = 0.25).\n\nThe confidence interval in the fuller models is roughly -0.75 to +0.19, on an outcome whose mean is about 100. That rules out any sizeable effect, so \"no detectable effect\" is a fair summary.\n\nTwo caveats. The report left out the 2020 patent baseline as a control, even though it predicts both remote share and 2023 patents. Adding it barely moves the estimate. The data are also a single cross-section, so a causal reading rests on the controls."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":592,"cache_read_input_tokens":12312,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":592,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":380,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"07976c82-19e9-44f7-98c2-f2e4fde80fe0","uuid":"732f14fe-d7a9-4e4e-b7f9-721312578efa"}
